ons next to a beautiful sea.<br><br>*Characters:<br>Violeta: A lovely girl who will be in search of her beloved.<br>Robot Gedor: Your ally who will provide you with tools to solve the puzzles.<br>Camilo: The lost one.<br><br>Single Player: Girl Up currently supports single-player mode.<br><br>Abilities: Violeta possesses the Time-Jump ability, which allows her to return to a specific location.<br><br>*Vehicle: You'll be able to control vehicles for greater agility.<br>Girl, UP.",
